  "quote": "The only security deposit that a landlord may collect is a rent deposit collected in accordance with section 106.",
  "reason": "A refundable pet deposit held against potential damage is a security deposit as defined in section 105(2), and section 105(1) prohibits collecting any security deposit other than a rent deposit. Because the clause is inconsistent with section 105, it is void under section 4(1)."
